From 7cddd7373e97846aafba77a423276b156485dc6c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 11:15:30 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 4/4] Fix: posture fit: strength tiers, MOVES LIKE THIS,
 reaction sizes, raw reactions, watch and take-part focus, off-balance
 wear-off and take-off said for a fighter in the air, lying down or on top of
 a pin

---
 engine.py   | 33 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++--
 narrator.py | 61 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++-------
 rules.json  |  9 ++++++--
 3 files changed, 91 insertions(+), 12 deletions(-)

